<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-LEADING AUSTRALIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING AUSTRALIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading completed second round</p>
<p>scores in the Australian Open at the par-72 Australian Golf Club</p>
<p>course on Friday (Australian unless stated, 39 players to</p>
<p>complete rain-affected rounds on Saturday):</p>
<p>142 Rolf Muntz (Netherlands) 71 71</p>
<p>143 Rodger Davis 71 72</p>
<p>145 Richard Green 70 75, David Howell (Britain) 70 75, David</p>
<p>Smail (New Zealand) 72 73</p>
<p>146 Justin Cooper 72 74, Steven Conran 75 71</p>
<p>147 Brett Partridge 70 77, Grant Waite (New Zealand) 72 75</p>
<p>148 Robert Stephens 69 79, David Ecob 75 73</p>
<p>149 Jack Kay (Canada) 75 74, John Senden 77 72</p>
<p>150 Jerry Kelly (U.S.) 73 77, Steve Alker (New Zealand) 72 78,</p>
<p>Michael Long (New Zealand) 75 75, Michael Clayton 73 77</p>
<p>151 Adrian Percey 72 79, Kenny Druce 78 73, Terry Pilkadaris 78</p>
<p>73, Tiger Woods (U.S.) 79 72, Peter Lonard 78 73, Wayne Riley 76</p>
<p>75, Marcus Cain 78 73</p>
